  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IM EU own contribution Nepal 2019-2022</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IM EU-egeninsats Nepal 2019-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Individuell M&#xe4;nniskohj&#xe4;lp (IM) har ans&#xf6;kt om finansiering av egeninsats om 581 041 SEK f&#xf6;r EU-projektet &quot;Enhancing Sub-National Good Governance in Nepal&quot; under perioden 2019-2022. Insatsen har EU-kommissionens referensnummer EuropeAid/159739/DD/ACT/NP.

Insatsen syftar till att &#xf6;ka medborgares deltagande i det subnationella styret (p&#xe5; lokal och provinsiell niv&#xe5;) inom ramen f&#xf6;r det nya federala systemet i Nepal. 

Insatsen har en total budget p&#xe5; 1 108 890 EUR, vilket motsvarar cirka 11 620 723 SEK. S&#xf6;kt st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Sida &#xe4;r 581 041 SEK vilket motsvarar cirka 5 procent av den totala budgeten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Development Partner (IM) has applied to Sida for funding of 581 041 SEK to carry out the EU-project &quot;Enhancing Sub-National Good Governance in Nepal&quot; during the period 2019-2022. The contribution has the EU commission reference number EuropeAid/159739/DD/ACT/NP.

The purpose of the contribution is to enhance citizens&apos; participation in sub-national good governance (local and provincial level) in the context of the new federal system in Nepal.

The contribution&apos;s total budget is 1 108 890 EUR, corresponding to approximately 11 620 723 SEK. The requested support from Sida is 581 041 SEK, which corresponds to approximately 5 per cent of the total budget.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka medborgares deltagande i det subnationella styret (p&#xe5; lokal och provinsiell niv&#xe5;) inom ramen f&#xf6;r det nya federala systemet i Nepal.</narrative>
  </description>
